meta {
  name: Resource Comments - Delete
  type: http
  seq: 58
}

delete {
  url: {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/communities/nswswk8w8wso0ko8owwk8k0w/spaces/z40cggggsksggkgskkwocock/resources/<resource cuid>/comments/<comment cuid>
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "delete_replies": false
  }
}

docs {
  Deletes a comment on a resource: its author or a moderator of the space, with the rules of `Comments - Delete` (#1565, ADR 0050). A comment that has replies of other people stays as a marker with every reply (200); any other comment goes with its replies (204). `delete_replies` true (moderators only, 403 for the others) deletes the comment and every reply under it. Token ability: `resources:write`.
}
